        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="AcFJhxBT_vqd_4cILIRe-3" value="Journey &amp; Instructions" style="" parent="AcFJhxBT_vqd_4cILIRe-0" />
        <mxCell id="AcFJhxBT_vqd_4cILIRe-5" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;1.) Foundation for metric &amp;amp; ladder&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Identify for each maturity area elements such as motivators or methods&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;These elements build upon each other, ensure that you have the foundation first.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Select the top 3 elements per box by relevance for the organization in focus&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;strokeWidth=10;spacingTop=12;fontFamily=Verdana;fontSize=20;align=left;spacing=16;" parent="AcFJhxBT_vqd_4cILIRe-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="470" y="1980" width="540" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="AcFJhxBT_vqd_4cILIRe-6" value="&lt;u style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;2. Run the assessment&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Structured approach&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;For a repetitive, structured approach create questionnaire with &amp;lt;=2 questions per box.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;Expert approach&lt;br style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;Get a diverse group of experts to judge in consensus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Result:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;agree (+1), neutral (0) or disagree (-1)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=20;fontFamily=Verdana;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#60a917;strokeColor=#2D7600;strokeWidth=10;spacingTop=12;spacing=16;fontColor=#ffffff;" parent="AcFJhxBT_vqd_4cILIRe-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1070" y="1980" width="540" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="AcFJhxBT_vqd_4cILIRe-10" value="&lt;u style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;4. Actionable solutions&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;With the guidance you can identify initiatives for the areas of importance.&lt;div&gt;Focus on „launch &amp;amp; learn“ (foundation) first. Move from left to right and then on the top.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;It might be more practicable to sometimes improve the efficiency before the effectiveness.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=20;fontFamily=Verdana;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;strokeWidth=10;spacingTop=12;align=left;spacing=16;" parent="AcFJhxBT_vqd_4cILIRe-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2260" y="1980" width="540" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="NPktaMn14VHzqkv4nWxG-26" value="&lt;b style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;3. Calculate maturity level per pillar&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Identify the driver per box by summarizing the results. To indicate the impact/weight of actions on higher levels, you might want to use the multiplier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Result:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;an indicator reflecting your driver towards the north star, per pillar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Verdana;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=10;spacingTop=12;fontSize=20;align=left;spacing=16;" parent="AcFJhxBT_vqd_4cILIRe-3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1660" y="1980" width="540" height="240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
